            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah kodenya berfungsi atau tidak. Kode berfungsi jika pengujiannya berjalan <em>atau</em> output-nya memberikan hasil yang diinginkan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testsRun = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" outputShows = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = testsRun || outputShows \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Code working? : \\(result)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Code working? : true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>testsRun</code>, diikuti oleh <code>||</code>, dan terakhir <code>outputShows</code>.</p></body></html>"
